==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Pokémon GO|Meltan|45}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon GO}} expansion.
*'''Beam''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Porygon|103}} and {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Porygon2|104}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

